		"title": "Lumotive’s LCM Optical Semiconductor Platform Enables First Solid-State 180° dTOF LiDAR at 30 FPS",
		"slug": "lumotives-lcm-optical-semiconductor-platform-enables-first-solid-state-180-dtof-lidar-at-30-fps",
