		"title": "Lumotive, Yole Développement and LiDAR News to Host “LiDAR: One Size Does Not Fit All” Webinar, January 21, 2021",
		"slug": "lumotive-yole-developpement-and-lidar-news-to-host-lidar-one-size-does-not-fit-all-webinar-january-21-2021",
